# DevOps Build Project - E-applictaion

## EC2 Setup
- Launched Amazon Linux 2023
- Opened ports: 22, 80, 8080, 3001

## Installed Packages
sudo dnf update -y
sudo dnf install -y git vim docker
sudo systemctl enable --now docker
sudo usermod -aG docker ec2-user

## Installed Docker Compose
sudo mkdir -p /usr/local/lib/docker/cli-plugins
sudo curl -SL https://github.com/docker/compose/releases/latest/download/docker-compose-linux-x86_64 -o /usr/local/lib/docker/cli-plugins/docker-compose
sudo chmod +x /usr/local/lib/docker/cli-plugins/docker-compose

## Docker Build Test
docker build -t trend:test .
docker run -d -p 80:80 trend:test

## Jenkins Setup
- Installed Java 17
- Installed Jenkins
- Configured DockerHub credentials
- Created Multibranch Pipeline

## CI/CD Flow
- dev branch → pushes to DockerHub dev repo
- main branch → pushes to DockerHub prod repo
- Automatic deployment via docker-compose

## Monitoring
Installed Uptime Kuma using Docker.
